        "defect as Observation's missing assign_to_attribute support -- see the",
        "prostate_cancer.json PSA_Interpretation fix). Without the required",
        "'symptom' field, State$Symptom.process passes a null symptom name into",
        "person.setSymptom, which NPEs and discards the whole patient record --",
        "named explicitly in task 1.10's tree-wide static check of Symptom states",
        "missing this field. B_Symptoms two states later already uses the correct",
        "'symptom' field; this now matches that pattern."
      ],
      "symptom": "Lymphadenopathy",
      "cause": "Diffuse large B-cell lymphoma",
      "probability": 0.9,
