        "excisional lymph node biopsy. Recoded to 307996001 'Excisional biopsy of",
        "lymph node', verified active via the NCI EVS REST API",
        "(api-evsrest.nci.nih.gov/api/v1/concept/snomedct_us/307996001: name",
        "'Excisional biopsy of lymph node', active=true) and Verhoeff-valid. New",
        "hcpcs_code_map row added (CPT 38510, 'Biopsy or excision of lymph",
        "node(s); open, deep cervical node(s)' -- cervical lymphadenopathy is the",
        "most common diagnostic-biopsy presentation for DLBCL)."
      ],
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "307996001",
          "display": "Excisional biopsy of lymph node"
